From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yanan He <yanan.he@linux.alibaba.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Apr 2026 16:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] tools/attr.c: include libgen.h for basename()

musl libc does not declare basename() in <string.h>.
Include <libgen.h> which provides the POSIX basename() on all libc
implementations.

Signed-off-by: Yanan He <yanan.he@linux.alibaba.com>
---
 tools/attr.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/tools/attr.c b/tools/attr.c
index 1234567..abcdefg 100644
--- a/tools/attr.c
+++ b/tools/attr.c
@@ -27,6 +27,7 @@
 #include <errno.h>
 #include <string.h>
 #include <locale.h>
+#include <libgen.h>
 
 #include <attr/attributes.h>
 
